{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     subscribe — the newsletter form. Ported from NSDS's subscribe-form.html
     and .ns-cta-card (components/css/ghost.css, which NSDS wrote FOR Ghost).
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     data-members-form="subscribe" is Ghost's own hook: Ghost's members script
     intercepts the submit, posts the address and flips the elements marked
     data-members-success / data-members-error. There is no JavaScript of ours
     here, and no action URL to keep correct.

     BOTH RESPONSE MESSAGES EXIST UP FRONT, hidden. A live region created at
     the same moment as its message announces nothing — the region has to be
     in the DOM before the text lands in it.

     .ns-cta-card__form .ns-input carries `flex: 1`, so the field and the
     button lay out with no utility and no inline style.

     Takes optional label / text / fine parameters; the defaults are written
     for a site that has just launched.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
<form class="ns-cta-card" data-members-form="subscribe">
    <span class="ns-cta-card__label">{{> "icons/envelope"}} {{#if label}}{{label}}{{else}}{{t "Newsletter"}}{{/if}}</span>

    <p class="ns-cta-card__text">
        {{#if text}}{{text}}{{else}}{{t "This site is brand new and the curriculum is being written in the open. Subscribe and every new lesson, roadmap and teardown lands in your inbox as it ships."}}{{/if}}
    </p>

    <div class="ns-cta-card__form">
        <label class="ns-visually-hidden" for="subscribe-email">{{t "Email address"}}</label>
        <input id="subscribe-email" class="ns-input" type="email" name="email"
               autocomplete="email" required placeholder="{{t "you@example.com"}}" data-members-email>
        <button class="ns-btn ns-btn--primary" type="submit">
            {{> "icons/paper-plane-tilt"}} {{t "Subscribe"}}
        </button>
    </div>

    <span class="ns-cta-card__fine">{{#if fine}}{{fine}}{{else}}{{t "Free · no spam · unsubscribe any time"}}{{/if}}</span>

    <p class="ns-field__help" data-members-success role="status" hidden>
        {{t "Check your inbox — the confirmation link is on its way."}}
    </p>
    <p class="ns-field__error" data-members-error role="alert" hidden>
        {{t "That did not work. Check the address and try again."}}
    </p>
</form>
